# SecureAssist Langfuse secrets - TEMPLATE (no real values).
#
# 1. cp langfuse/.env.example langfuse/.env
# 2. replace every REPLACE_ME (README section F, Task 1 gives the exact openssl commands)
# 3. kubectl -n secureassist create secret generic secureassist-langfuse --from-env-file=langfuse/.env
#
# langfuse/.env is git-ignored - never commit it. No quotes, no spaces in values.

